     <para>
      避免在 <replaceable>array</replaceable> 变量上有 MCV 类型扩展统计信息时，
      <literal><replaceable>constant</replaceable>
      = ANY(<replaceable>array</replaceable>)</literal> 子句
      导致规划器核心转储（Tom Lane）
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c102d1106">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;476f9d533">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Alvaro Herrera <alvherre@alvh.no-ip.org>
