     <para>修复 <application>psql</application> 的 <literal>ON_ERROR_ROLLBACK</literal> 功能，使其正确处理 <literal>COMMIT AND CHAIN</literal> 命令（Arthur Nascimento） <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;be7485a1e">&sect;</ulink></para>

     <para>以前，这种情况会以 <quote>savepoint "pg_psql_temporary_savepoint" does not exist</quote> 错误失败。</para>
    </listitem>

