Branch: REL_13_STABLE [5efa788e1] 2020-10-11 21:31:40 -0700
-->
     <para>改进 PPC 上为 compare_exchange 和 fetch_add 操作生成的代码（Noah Misch） <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d41cb63ff">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5efa788e1">&sect;</ulink></para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [e55f718fc] 2020-09-26 16:04:06 -0400
Branch: REL_13_STABLE [f7873900f] 2020-09-26 16:04:06 -0400
